ajOdQU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSRN1xBv8aVKTNImAg8NZp2_ncGfHOrL5ztLmz0GPWfmw&oe=6AE8B011"}, {"file_name": "1 SC - World.png", "id": "3396821733804461", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821115_3396821737137794_340421123404825388_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IH2d1oKsln8Q7kNvwFv4xrQ&_nc_oc=AdrG98wYFanKJFW-wPgOqbzUEVxSWFEhm1pfdBSIV2oFnY9KjaMq12mFWP4QGCfrNGM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRxY5Jo9QILZ3vtxx7KAg0fFspG-X4iZIWEEducclB8Og&oe=6AE8918F"}, {"file_name": "4 SC - Rougelike.png", "id": "820505160792330", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821702_820505164125663_7924103931815905257_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fWQIsCX12XQQ7kNvwGrt3U_&_nc_oc=Adr831CADLn4c4-QxURALdx0Pd9dflV9uWYZnmxDLb-o3tL-pmwIwEjgVsRmeoqgwSU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRORyhOdJ4w5jiMw5jdRjgqWgssjuoiPVFESa6Oxo6nlQ&oe=6AE8B587"}, {"file_name": "5 SC - Evolve.png", "id": "2249413632247626", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_2249413635580959_4401107030297838154_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MniGnnlR6rcQ7kNvwFgHcsr&_nc_oc=AdqJnIga-BGp49dPVWvSjsYZS2xubvsdKiAw0-2ZdqCzEj98odqKPgHZny-RLy5YFQA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTaeS1VtduMNq44KPcSoQN4VtZxfnALYl-CWiXB-Pjc1A&oe=6AE8C10E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Thumbnail.png", "id": "832008162928160", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827567_832008166261493_2325861839012386275_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2IfSvaC8nQEQ7kNvwHltl_V&_nc_oc=AdoVI4r9H8oHOqER014ylyaO2erq9RunhoiR_z0MKaVwGDkChcGGzuV0lK0WmF0zBg4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ0wgoqMuKNW1Iz8ov1TCQM2JzrgS3-PrOBH3PXkCrcZg&oe=6AE8B53B"}, "display_name": "Plasmaborne Demo", "keywords": ["Shooter", "Rougelike", "Boom", "Hell"], "long_description": "# In this demo version, you have a limited amount of weapons and abilities.\n\n# Fast. Fluid. Ferocious\nDescend into the abyss and tear through handcrafted arenas where speed, precision, and raw power rule. Plasmaborne is a high-intensity single-player VR roguelike shooter built for players who crave momentum, mastery, and chaos.\n{1551667349501830}\n# Evolve with Every Death\nFall. Rise. Adapt. Collect upgrades, forge new builds, and return stronger than before. Each failure feeds progress, sharpening your instincts and unlocking new ways to fight.\n{1177653031011467}\n# Dual-Wield Destruction\nBuild your own loadout, each hand with a powerful weapon and layer on passives that reshape your playstyle. Build your kit in the lobby, then unleash it in the arena. Every run becomes a different kind of chaos.\n{1534745057571181}\nFusing tight gunplay, brutal melee, and searing flamethrower chaos into one relentless VR combat experience.\n{1113144070708568}\n# Handcrafted Arenas. Infinite Replay\nEach battleground pushes fresh tactics and reactions. Learn enemy behaviors, chain stylish dashes, and ride perfect momentum through escalating challenges.", "short_description": "Plasmaborne is a fast, high-intensity VR roguelike shooter built for players who thrive on speed and precision. Tear through handcrafted arenas with dual-wielded weapons and powerful passives like swords, flamethrowers, and character augments. Build your loadout in the lobby, teleport-dash through escalating enemies, and unlock upgrades that transform every run. Built for full-motion VR, Plasmaborne delivers heavy recoil, crisp gunfeel, and endlessly replayable combat."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://cybersnake-x.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Cybersnake-X", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/9TX8fvD62e", "website_url": "https://cybersnake-x.com/", "